| `scripts/corpus_vocabulary.py` | Holds `OWNER_SOURCES`, the closed set of CONVENTIONS §12 owner sources a corpus node may carry, so check_corpus refuses a node outside it and the accountability report counts by the same set. It imports nothing, so the report reads a corpus without loading the corpus gate. | imported by its bare name | — | Not where build_corpus decides a node's source, and it reads no config. | [deterministic-checks.md](../guides/deterministic-checks.md) | always |
